              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Jaipur is a commercial two-player card game by Sébastien Pauchon where merchants collect goods, trade camels, and sell sets for tokens and bonuses."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Asmodee in 2009, Jaipur became a widely recommended two-player card game and won strong critical reception."
            }
